    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i have a huge presentation tomorrow and im super nervous. my hands are shaking like crazy and my heart is racing. i have some propranolol left over from before, do u think its okay if i take a pill now to help me stay calm for the speech? i do have asthma but it's usually fine with a puffer",
